1 0 0 1 40 780 Tm
(APPOINTMENT PACKET ? Germany) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This is a PREPARATION file. Ellis has NOT submitted anything:) Tj
T*
(this visa is decided in person, and only you can attend.) Tj
T*
(Bring this folder, and check every item before you go.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  Applicant: XIANGWEI CAO) Tj
T*
(  Route:     Embassy Or Consulate Application) Tj
T*
(  Post:      German Consulate General Guangzhou \(applications submitted via VFS Global Visa Application Centre Guangzhou\)) Tj
T*
(             NOT YET CONFIRMED as the post for your residence ?) Tj
T*
(             check with them before you travel.) Tj
T*
(  Source:    https://china.diplo.de/cn-en) Tj
T*
(  Fee:       not confirmed by Ellis ? verify with the post before you travel) Tj
T*
(  APPOINTMENT: not booked yet ? book it in Ellis's secure window before) Tj
T*
(             you print this folder.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(BEFORE YOU GO) Tj
T*
(  Nothing outstanding: every required document is on file) Tj
T*
(  and every required form field is filled.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(WHAT IS IN THIS FOLDER) Tj
T*
(  1. Schengen Uniform Visa Application ? filled, UNSIGNED \(sign it by hand at the post\)) Tj
T*
(  2. 7586b9edea44b6ff5e13f4a2ba7b0f2c \(2\).jpg) Tj
T*
(  3. Screenshot 2026-08-02 at 10.57.45?PM.jpg) Tj
T*
(  4. schengen_uniform.pdf) Tj
T*
(  5. dbe7bb8affc7b186491944098b52c1f6 \(2\).jpg) Tj
T*
(  6. 02_round_trip_flight_itinerary_SAMPLE.pdf) Tj
T*
(  7. 03_hotel_booking_confirmation_SAMPLE.pdf) Tj
T*
(  8. View PDF Statement_2026-05-31 \(1\) \(1\).pdf) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ON THE DAY) Tj
T*
(  1. Bring your ORIGINAL passport, not a copy.) Tj
T*
(  2. Bring this folder and the printed form; sign the form only where and) Tj
T*
(      when the officer tells you to.) Tj
T*
(  3. Arrive early ? many posts refuse late arrivals and rebooking can) Tj
T*
(      take weeks.) Tj
T*
(  4. Expect to give fingerprints and a photograph.) Tj
T*
(  5. Pay the fee by the method the post accepts; confirm this in advance.) Tj
T*
(  6. Keep every receipt and the tracking number you are given.) Tj
T*
(  7. Print this form, sign it by hand \(fields 37 and 38\), and bring it to) Tj
T*
(      your appointment with your passport, photo and supporting documents.) Tj
T*
(      Ellis cannot submit a Schengen visa application: it is decided in) Tj
T*
(      person, with biometrics.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Ellis prepared this file from the answers and documents you) Tj
T*
(gave it. It is not legal advice and not a government decision.) Tj
T*
ET
